hm	27. oct. 2008	rev 1.1
	integrator will not be adjusted when ki = 0

hm	25. jan 2009	rev 1.2
	module will also work with negative K

hm	11. mar. 2009	rev 1.3
	real constants updated to new systax using dot

*)
END_FUNCTION_BLOCK
